        If the compression fails, [=throw=] an error.</li>
      <li>Let |transformerBlock| be a [=transformer block=] containing |compressedTransformer|.</li>
      <li>Append |transformerBlock| to |transformerBlocks|.</li>
      <li>Increment |transformerIndex| by 1.</li>
    </ol>
  </li>

  <li>If |options| is provided and |options|["dictionary"] is provided:
    <ol>
      <li>Let |dictionaryData| be |options|["dictionary"].</li>
      <li>Let |compressedDictionary| be the result of [=compressing a byte sequence=] with |dictionaryData| using the Zstandard compression method.
        If the compression fails, [=throw=] an error.</li>
      <li>Let |dictionaryBlock| be a [=dictionary block=] containing |compressedDictionary|.</li>
      <li>Append |dictionaryBlock| to |dictionaryBlocks|.</li>
      <li>Increment |dictionaryIndex| by 1.</li>
    </ol>
  </li>

