    If |options| is provided and |options|["chunk_size"] is provided, set |chunkSize| to |options|["chunk_size"].
    Otherwise, set |chunkSize| to 2<sup>21</sup> - 1 (the maximum Zstandard block size).</li>

  <li>Let |chunkOffset| be 0.</li>
  <li>Let |chunkIndex| be 0.</li>
  <li>Let |compressedChunks| be an empty list.</li>

  <li>While |chunkOffset| is less than |inputSize|:
    <ol>
      <li>Let |remainingSize| be |inputSize| - |chunkOffset|.</li>
      <li>Let |currentChunkSize| be min(|remainingSize|, |chunkSize|).</li>

      <li>Let |chunkData| be the result of reading |currentChunkSize| bytes from |inputFile| starting at offset |chunkOffset|.
        If the read fails, [=throw=] an error.</li>

      <li>If |options| is provided and |options|["transformer"] is provided:
        <ol>
          <li>Let |transformedData| be the result of applying the transformer specified by |options|["transformer"] to |chunkData| as preprocessing.
            If the transformation fails, [=throw=] an error.</li>
          <li>Set |chunkData| to |transformedData|.</li>
        </ol>
      </li>

      <li>Let |compressionParams| be an empty byte sequence.</li>
      <li>Let |compressedData| be an empty byte sequence.
      <li>Let |useCompression| be true.</li>

      <li>If |options| is provided and |options|["dictionary"] is provided:
        <ol>
          <li>Let |dictionary| be the dictionary data from |dictionaryBlocks|[0].</li>
          <li>Set |compressionParams| to the Zstandard [=window_descriptor=] for |dictionary|.</li>
          <li>Let |compressedData| be the result of compressing |chunkData| using Zstandard with |dictionary|.
            If the compression fails, set |useCompression| to false.</li>
        </ol>
      </li>
      <li>Otherwise:
        <ol>
          <li>Let |compressedData| be the result of compressing |chunkData| using Zstandard without a dictionary.
            If the compression fails, set |useCompression| to false.</li>
        </ol>
      </li>

      <li>Determine whether to use compression:
        <ol>
          <li>If |useCompression| is false, continue to the next step.</li>

          <li>Let |compressedSize| be the length of |compressedData| in bytes.</li>
          <li>Let |originalSize| be the length of |chunkData| in bytes.</li>

          <li>If |compressedSize| is greater than or equal to |originalSize|:
            <ol>
              <li>Set |useCompression| to false.
              <div class=note>
                This indicates that the data is [=barely compressible=] and should be stored uncompressed.
